# Configurações visuais do terminal
Output assets/demo.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Padding 30
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

# Comandos executados na demo
Type "cargo run --example demo"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Sleep 2s
Type "2"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "2"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "2"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "2"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "2"
Enter
Sleep 4s
